{
 "_doc": "The Effects panel (F7, ui/effects_panel.gd; game/settings/render_switches.gd). Each item is an effect or layer switched on and off live, to measure what it costs: `layers` are the names of native/src/render/render_layers.h, hidden by the camera's cull mask (no instance touched); `effect` is one thing of the renderer. resolutions: the share of the 3D scale the panel offers. Switches of systems the game does not have yet (clouds, weather, particles, transit) come with the session that ports them.",
